<title>USA: Eskimo Pie stake boosted by Gabelli group.</title>
<headline>Eskimo Pie stake boosted by Gabelli group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by New York investor Mario Gabelli said Thursday it raised its stake in Eskimo Pie Corp to 318,500 common shares, or 9.25 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions included the purchase of 26,000 shares between March 7 and March 18 at prices ranging from $12.00 to $12.75 a share.</p>
<p>The Richmond, Va.-based company, which created the Eskimo Pie ice cream bar, markets a line of frozen products.</p>
</text>
